!Quantification issues with ROI
* No problem with explicitly quantified sumti tags: ''xy. roi .ybu broda'' means "X in Y broda".
* For xorlo, assume, per ((Powell's Principle of Non-Gluteality)), that it refers to "X times per broda".

!Relevant prior discussions (working notes)
!!re'u
* http://nuzban.wiw.org/archive/9612/msg00006.html
** Summary: re'u is semantically related to the ZAhO series, in that it specifies a phase of the event. (This discussion is suggestive of calling re'u an ''aspect'', and not a tense.)
* ((re'u))
** Summary: za'u re'u means "not for the first time", so it could be used for some senses of "again".
!!roi
* http://www.lojban.org/lists/jboske/msg00218.html
** Summary: NB! ROI is a sumti tcita, too. The sumti specifies which time interval the repetitions occur.
* http://www.lojban.org/publications/reference_grammar/chapter10.html
** Summary: __no__ CLL examples of re'u/roi with tagged sumti!! Can the meaning of the tagged sumti be understood in relation to that of TAhE (for roi) and ZAhO (for re'u)?

! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''re'u''

;__re'u__ (ROI): Ordinal tense. Converts a number to an objectively quantified ordinal tense interval modifier, indicating that the event takes place for the ''n''-th time. When tagging a sumti, the sumti specifies the interval in which the repetitions occur.
** Keywords: for the nth time.

!! Examples of ''re'u'' Usage
''.i ro da poi se mrilu fu le mriciste zo'u mi pa po'o re'u te benji da''%%%
I receive each message through the mailing system only once.

''.i mi re re'u troci lo nu co'a sipna''%%%
For the second time, I try to fall asleep.

!! Proposed Definition of ''roi''

;__roi__ (ROI): Quantified tense. Converts a number to an objectively quantified tense interval modifier, indicating that the event takes place ''n'' times. When tagging a sumti, the sumti specifies the interval in which the repetitions occur.
** Keywords: times. n times.

!! Examples of ''roi'' Usage
''curmi le nu pilno le su'ore dacti paroi le jufra''%%%
It allows using multiple objects once per sentence.

''mi so'iroi citka lo xarju''%%%
I eat pork many times.

! Notes
The meaning of tagged sumti with ROI, previously undescribed, has been explicitly laid out.

